WEBVTT

00:00:05.378 --> 00:00:08.279
The Irresponsible Captain
Tylor

00:00:09.048 --> 00:00:11.917
We may be off the maps...
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:11.917 --> 00:00:13.976
...but let's stay on this voyage.
Chizu ni Nai Tabi Tsuzukeyou

00:00:14.820 --> 00:00:18.950
I will be holding, never let you go.

00:00:20.526 --> 00:00:23.362
Whatever we may want...
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:23.362 --> 00:00:25.489
...we'll take as we need.
Hoshimono wa Tsukamu no sa

00:00:26.265 --> 00:00:30.292
So let's just go wherever we please!
Omoi no Mama Yukou!

00:00:32.004 --> 00:00:34.774
Make me your partner...
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:34.774 --> 00:00:37.402
...on this journey.
Kotoba yori Tashikana Koto

00:00:37.677 --> 00:00:41.272
One that you trust more than words!
Michizure ni Shite

00:00:42.715 --> 00:00:47.379
Come on now and sail away for future!
Imasugu sail away for future

00:00:48.387 --> 00:00:49.889
Things are waiting...
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:49.889 --> 00:00:53.086
...that we've never seen before!
Mishiranu Nanika ga Matteru sa

00:00:54.927 --> 00:00:57.096
Just take your cares...
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:00:57.096 --> 00:01:01.157
...and throw them all away.
Kodawari Minna Sutetara

00:01:01.400 --> 00:01:06.030
Come together, just think of tomorrow.

00:01:07.807 --> 00:01:09.297
Let's go!

00:01:12.511 --> 00:01:15.947
A PLACE FOR CONFESSION

00:01:39.905 --> 00:01:41.065
What's wrong, Tylor?

00:01:41.574 --> 00:01:43.337
Oh, my stomach's full!

00:01:43.976 --> 00:01:46.911
But Azalyn invited me here...

00:01:46.979 --> 00:01:50.506
...and she looks like she's
enjoying herself so much.

00:01:51.650 --> 00:01:54.915
I've never seen her so happy.

00:01:55.187 --> 00:01:56.654
Azalyn's a nice kid.

00:02:03.596 --> 00:02:04.392
Paco-Paco?

00:02:04.663 --> 00:02:05.288
Yeah?

00:02:06.699 --> 00:02:07.495
Do you like them?

00:02:07.633 --> 00:02:08.156
Yeah.

00:02:08.334 --> 00:02:11.599
Good, then let's pick more.
Help me, will you?

00:02:11.937 --> 00:02:12.665
Sure!

00:02:15.641 --> 00:02:16.300
Highness.

00:02:17.643 --> 00:02:20.578
May I ask one thing?

00:02:20.813 --> 00:02:21.507
What?

00:02:22.014 --> 00:02:25.677
Why do you like Tylor so much?

00:02:27.887 --> 00:02:28.785
Well...

00:02:29.989 --> 00:02:32.924
When Paco-Paco is with me,
I feel a great sense of peace.

00:02:35.361 --> 00:02:37.625
Hey! Azalyn!

00:02:37.997 --> 00:02:39.965
Right! Coming!

00:02:41.567 --> 00:02:43.262
A great sense of peace?

00:02:49.375 --> 00:02:51.468
Aft damage: 12 percent!

00:02:55.047 --> 00:02:56.981
At this rate, we're sunk!

00:02:57.049 --> 00:03:00.075
But the ones attacking
us are UPSF forces!

00:03:02.388 --> 00:03:06.381
To return fire or not return
fire... That is the question!

00:03:09.695 --> 00:03:12.027
They're following HQ's
orders to the letter...

00:03:12.331 --> 00:03:14.322
...and are attacking
one of their own ships!

00:03:14.733 --> 00:03:16.325
This is being a good soldier!

00:03:16.602 --> 00:03:18.900
Approaching asteroid
cluster ahead!

00:03:19.071 --> 00:03:19.662
What?!

00:03:20.973 --> 00:03:23.567
We'll never avoid them
unless we cut our speed!

00:03:23.943 --> 00:03:26.707
And if we do that,
we'll get picked off!

00:03:30.983 --> 00:03:32.245
What do we do?!

00:03:34.687 --> 00:03:36.086
If Tylor were here...

00:03:39.425 --> 00:03:42.861
If the captain were here,
what would he do?

00:03:43.429 --> 00:03:46.057
If the captain were here?

00:03:50.102 --> 00:03:54.505
Right, full speed ahead!
Take us into the asteroids!

00:03:55.441 --> 00:03:58.171
If we hit one of them,
it's all over!

00:03:58.444 --> 00:04:01.413
Then we'd better not hit any!
Full speed ahead!

00:04:01.614 --> 00:04:02.512
A- Aye, aye!

00:04:03.349 --> 00:04:04.179
Lieutenant...

00:04:15.094 --> 00:04:17.654
Paco-Paco, does your
stomach hurt that badly?

00:04:18.130 --> 00:04:21.725
Yeah, but I think it's
gotten a little better.

00:04:23.135 --> 00:04:23.999
Paco-Paco...

00:04:24.336 --> 00:04:25.098
I'm okay!

00:04:26.005 --> 00:04:26.664
Highness.

00:04:27.273 --> 00:04:28.934
Enter. What did you learn?

00:04:29.475 --> 00:04:33.775
When I asked the doctors, they said
they could do nothing to help Tylor.

00:04:34.113 --> 00:04:37.048
Why not?! Paco-Paco is my pet!

00:04:37.783 --> 00:04:40.775
Tylor is not
of our race, Highness.

00:04:41.120 --> 00:04:44.886
His different biology makes
our curing him impossible.

00:04:45.257 --> 00:04:46.058
But...

00:04:46.058 --> 00:04:47.218
It's okay!

00:04:48.761 --> 00:04:50.456
I just ate too much.

00:04:52.665 --> 00:04:55.225
Paco-Paco, isn't there
anything you want?

00:04:55.367 --> 00:04:56.732
Do you still ache anywhere?

00:04:57.803 --> 00:05:00.795
If anything happened to you,
I don't know what I'd do!

00:05:01.840 --> 00:05:03.899
She's given her heart to Tylor!

00:05:11.684 --> 00:05:13.675
Asteroid cluster, cleared!

00:05:13.953 --> 00:05:17.150
It worked! Now they'll
never catch us!

00:05:18.123 --> 00:05:20.284
I almost thought we
weren't going to make it!

00:05:20.526 --> 00:05:21.993
We were lucky.

00:05:22.528 --> 00:05:24.792
I don't think we'll ever
luck out like that again!

00:05:25.197 --> 00:05:26.357
You're wrong!

00:05:26.799 --> 00:05:27.424
Lieutenant!

00:05:27.833 --> 00:05:30.028
Right, now to save the captain!

00:05:30.302 --> 00:05:33.066
Locate the Raalgon main
fleet at once!

00:05:33.372 --> 00:05:36.967
What? Locate their main fleet?
Lieutenant, don't you know?

00:05:38.544 --> 00:05:40.774
About the Soyokaze's
broken-down old radar?

00:05:41.180 --> 00:05:43.171
Quit making excuses
and give it a try!

00:05:43.549 --> 00:05:45.574
A- Aye, aye, Lieutenant!

00:05:49.555 --> 00:05:50.146
That's!

00:05:50.556 --> 00:05:52.285
The Raalgon main fleet!

00:05:52.558 --> 00:05:55.049
See? I told you.

00:05:58.230 --> 00:06:03.463
The fleet just vanished! I think
they're using a radar jammer.

00:06:03.702 --> 00:06:04.760
Still have their position?

00:06:04.970 --> 00:06:06.171
Of course I kept it!

00:06:06.171 --> 00:06:08.571
Right, then we'll warp
there at once!

00:06:08.741 --> 00:06:13.405
Warp there?! But they'll open
fire the second we warp out!

00:06:13.746 --> 00:06:16.681
And if we materialize at the same
coordinates as the enemy fleet...

00:06:16.749 --> 00:06:18.683
...we could be annihilated
in a quantum explosion!

00:06:18.851 --> 00:06:22.343
We're saving the captain no
matter what! Don't worry!

00:06:22.688 --> 00:06:24.952
We'll just have to charge
in and face them like men!

00:06:25.858 --> 00:06:28.793
Lieutenant Yamamoto...
He's acting like Tylor!

00:06:29.928 --> 00:06:33.329
Just warp in there?
Yamamoto's being pretty rash.

00:06:33.599 --> 00:06:37.535
I hoped things would be a little
more normal with Tylor gone, but...

00:06:37.936 --> 00:06:41.064
The irresponsible captain has an
irresponsible first officer, huh?

00:06:44.843 --> 00:06:46.367
We finally get to be
in a real fight.

00:06:46.612 --> 00:06:49.206
Saving Mr. Tylor is
just a matter of time.

00:06:49.448 --> 00:06:51.784
Yeah. The lieutenant
started acting that way...

00:06:51.784 --> 00:06:53.911
...the minute he
thought Tylor was dead.

00:06:54.486 --> 00:06:56.613
We'd better be
ready for anything.

00:06:57.056 --> 00:07:00.651
We've always been ready
for anything. Right?

00:07:00.793 --> 00:07:01.384
Right!

00:07:05.297 --> 00:07:07.356
Captain, please be all right.

00:07:07.566 --> 00:07:09.295
Don't worry about him, Harumi.

00:07:10.135 --> 00:07:15.232
He's probably stuffing himself
on fine Raalgon cuisine.

00:07:15.340 --> 00:07:19.777
It's much healthier to
just have a drink and relax.

00:07:21.647 --> 00:07:22.909
Warp, ready and standing by!

00:07:23.315 --> 00:07:24.475
Commence warp!

00:07:50.843 --> 00:07:54.006
Enemy destroyer has
appeared in sector 38!

00:07:54.279 --> 00:07:56.679
Approaching ship!
Approaching ship!

00:07:57.950 --> 00:08:00.475
Lieutenant, send in a rescue
party before we're fired upon!

00:08:00.986 --> 00:08:02.453
There's no time to lose!

00:08:03.355 --> 00:08:05.084
Organize a rescue party!

00:08:05.491 --> 00:08:08.187
They'll break into the enemy
ship to get the captain!

00:08:08.494 --> 00:08:10.826
All other hands,
prepare for enemy attack!

00:08:16.702 --> 00:08:19.102
Now, stay with me!
Is that clear?!

00:08:19.204 --> 00:08:19.966
Roger!

00:08:20.372 --> 00:08:22.431
Enemy attack! Enemy attack!

00:08:24.543 --> 00:08:25.601
An enemy attack?!

00:08:25.944 --> 00:08:30.849
Yes. I was away from my post
when this failure occurred.

00:08:30.849 --> 00:08:32.282
The responsibility is entirely...

00:08:32.351 --> 00:08:37.015
Well, then, shouldn't we get
Azalyn to a safe place first?

00:08:37.723 --> 00:08:39.156
That goes without saying!

00:08:39.391 --> 00:08:41.484
Take Her Highness to
a safe place at once!

00:08:42.828 --> 00:08:46.127
Highness,
leave everything to me!

00:08:46.632 --> 00:08:48.657
Paco-Paco, does your
stomach still hurt?

00:08:48.734 --> 00:08:50.998
Um, I think it's fine, now.

00:08:54.406 --> 00:08:56.271
Class-7 chaff, fire!

00:08:59.278 --> 00:09:00.575
Tha- That's impossible!

00:09:00.979 --> 00:09:04.346
There's more than one ship!
They're coming at us from below!

00:09:04.550 --> 00:09:06.575
Switch to a fighter-
based response!

00:09:19.631 --> 00:09:24.034
Ranpu and Shinryus, away.
Dropship launch in 30 seconds.

00:09:24.236 --> 00:09:27.364
Our chaff's tricked them into
launching a fighter response.

00:09:28.106 --> 00:09:31.234
Give Andressen a smoke screen to
cover his approach to their ship!

00:09:32.110 --> 00:09:34.408
We have to rescue the captain
before they move in the big guns!

00:09:54.600 --> 00:09:57.398
Emi! Yumi! Keep track of
how many you shoot down...

00:09:57.469 --> 00:10:00.165
...or you'll have trouble when it's
time to paint on your kill marks.

00:10:00.405 --> 00:10:01.303
Roger that!

00:10:01.640 --> 00:10:02.868
They won't beat us!

00:10:12.084 --> 00:10:13.415
What're these?

00:10:13.485 --> 00:10:15.510
The lieutenant ordered
everyone to carry one.

00:10:15.787 --> 00:10:17.755
So, if we're lucky,
we get hand-to-hand combat.

00:10:17.823 --> 00:10:20.121
If we're not, we just get
blown to space dust.

00:10:22.060 --> 00:10:23.925
Dropship, ready to launch!

00:10:24.496 --> 00:10:26.088
Right! Launch!

00:10:30.602 --> 00:10:32.467
We're headed into the enemy ship!

00:10:33.138 --> 00:10:35.504
We haven't gone toe-to-toe
in an enemy ship in a while!

00:10:35.841 --> 00:10:37.274
Don't lose your nerve!

00:10:52.925 --> 00:10:54.756
Come on! Come on! Come on!

00:11:00.299 --> 00:11:00.958
Gotcha!

00:11:03.402 --> 00:11:04.767
Why, you!

00:11:09.641 --> 00:11:11.905
The UPSF must have
very brave soldiers...

00:11:12.110 --> 00:11:15.079
...for them to risk an
attack on the Melva.

00:11:15.547 --> 00:11:17.649
Paco-Paco, doesn't
it concern you?

00:11:17.649 --> 00:11:19.742
Yeah, I wonder who they are?

00:11:23.622 --> 00:11:24.350
Dom...

00:11:27.759 --> 00:11:29.818
Tylor, protect her.

00:11:31.663 --> 00:11:32.630
Just leave this to me!

00:11:39.905 --> 00:11:42.601
All right, let's knock on
the heart of the enemy!

00:11:42.708 --> 00:11:45.370
We don't need to knock
for them, Andressen!

00:11:45.577 --> 00:11:46.373
Eat this!

00:11:54.953 --> 00:11:56.648
Let's do it, people!

00:12:22.981 --> 00:12:24.642
Looks like they made it in.

00:12:24.983 --> 00:12:28.783
The question is whether we can hold
out till they rescue the captain.

00:12:29.287 --> 00:12:32.882
And even if they rescue him,
can we make it back alive?

00:12:33.158 --> 00:12:35.820
Don't worry.
Things will work out.

00:12:36.261 --> 00:12:38.661
If the captain were here,
that's what he'd say.

00:12:39.164 --> 00:12:40.028
Right, Lieutenant?

00:12:42.501 --> 00:12:45.993
Exactly! Do your best and
trust in providence!

00:12:46.071 --> 00:12:49.598
That's the secret to battle
and I believe in it!

00:12:58.784 --> 00:12:59.716
Huh?!

00:13:06.691 --> 00:13:08.215
There're tons of them!

00:13:08.460 --> 00:13:10.792
You idiot! This is no
time to be impressed!

00:13:11.196 --> 00:13:13.323
You will not get
one step past me!

00:13:14.199 --> 00:13:15.291
Wow!

00:13:15.834 --> 00:13:19.133
I thought a shelter would just
be some place for hiding in.

00:13:19.271 --> 00:13:21.262
But this is really luxurious!

00:13:22.474 --> 00:13:24.135
We've nothing to
worry about in here.

00:13:24.276 --> 00:13:25.834
Anyway, how is your stomach?

00:13:26.378 --> 00:13:28.778
All better, thanks to you.

00:13:29.247 --> 00:13:31.010
I'm happy to
hear that, Paco-Paco.

00:13:31.216 --> 00:13:32.911
But, if it happens again...

00:13:33.218 --> 00:13:37.052
...I'll ask Dom to bring
one of your doctors here.

00:13:37.155 --> 00:13:39.146
You sure have a lot
of strange things here.

00:13:40.025 --> 00:13:44.962
It's folk art I've received as
tribute from various worlds.

00:13:47.332 --> 00:13:49.562
Well, I suppose they're
all really valuable...

00:13:49.868 --> 00:13:51.529
...but I can't really
say I like them much.

00:13:52.237 --> 00:13:53.329
Paco-Paco?

00:13:54.873 --> 00:13:56.704
May I ask you for some advice?

00:14:06.585 --> 00:14:11.249
Soon now, the empire
will be mine!

00:14:15.527 --> 00:14:19.498
You're about to lose your life
"at the hands of the UPSF"...

00:14:19.498 --> 00:14:24.060
...just as your father did,
Your Imperial Highness!

00:14:30.242 --> 00:14:31.209
Engine room, hit!

00:14:31.409 --> 00:14:33.809
Warp system hit!
It'll be off-line for a while!

00:14:34.112 --> 00:14:37.809
No warp drive?! Then, even if we
save the captain, we can't escape!

00:14:38.150 --> 00:14:41.984
Don't lose hope!
Things will work out, right?!

00:14:43.889 --> 00:14:45.550
That's what the
captain would say!

00:14:45.924 --> 00:14:48.051
What's up? What do you
need advice about?

00:14:48.627 --> 00:14:51.562
Before I tell you, will you promise
not to tell anyone about this?

00:14:51.897 --> 00:14:52.886
Oh? Why?

00:14:52.964 --> 00:14:53.862
Because!

00:14:54.900 --> 00:14:56.595
Okay, I promise.

00:14:56.868 --> 00:14:59.359
You do. Well, then,
I'll tell you.

00:15:00.906 --> 00:15:01.634
You see...

00:15:06.311 --> 00:15:10.907
I have a, um, secret friend.
And this old friend, well...

00:15:11.917 --> 00:15:14.252
She thinks she's in fallen love
with a man for the first time.

00:15:14.252 --> 00:15:16.812
Oh? So, what's
this friend's name?

00:15:16.988 --> 00:15:18.717
Th- That's a secret.

00:15:19.291 --> 00:15:21.193
You've got a lot of secrets.

00:15:21.193 --> 00:15:22.524
Secrets are secret.

00:15:22.994 --> 00:15:24.325
I get you. And?

00:15:24.996 --> 00:15:30.127
And there's no way my friend
and this man can ever marry.

00:15:30.335 --> 00:15:33.862
Oh, that's too bad.
Big age difference between them?

00:15:34.339 --> 00:15:37.001
That's a good guess, Paco-Paco.
But not just that.

00:15:37.375 --> 00:15:39.809
You mean there
are other reasons?

00:15:43.348 --> 00:15:47.375
I know! Their parents are enemies,
like Romeo and what's her name.

00:15:47.552 --> 00:15:50.214
It's not quite like that,
but there are other reasons.

00:15:50.789 --> 00:15:54.919
More reasons? Are they from
REALLY different social classes?

00:15:57.529 --> 00:15:59.087
Yes, and...

00:15:59.364 --> 00:16:02.128
Well, I can't think
of any other reasons.

00:16:02.968 --> 00:16:04.333
The final reason is...

00:16:04.703 --> 00:16:05.931
The final reason is?

00:16:10.842 --> 00:16:11.604
It's...

00:16:11.943 --> 00:16:12.534
It's?

00:16:14.045 --> 00:16:16.639
The man that she loves
is extremely dense!

00:16:17.382 --> 00:16:20.283
Dense, huh? Well, there's no
shortage of THOSE guys!

00:16:20.952 --> 00:16:25.446
Don't you understand what I'm
telling you, Paco-Paco? I!

00:16:28.893 --> 00:16:30.827
I hate you, Paco-Paco!

00:16:31.196 --> 00:16:32.925
I hate you!

00:16:33.565 --> 00:16:35.863
Farewell, Your Imperial Highness!

00:17:19.778 --> 00:17:20.608
What the?!

00:17:40.498 --> 00:17:42.363
Wha- What happened, Paco-Paco?

00:17:43.101 --> 00:17:47.800
Wake up! Wake up! What's wrong?!
Can't you hear me?!

00:17:48.473 --> 00:17:49.440
Paco-Paco!

00:17:51.142 --> 00:17:53.042
I have to tell you something!

00:17:53.812 --> 00:17:54.744
Paco-Paco!

00:17:57.148 --> 00:17:58.638
Open your eyes!

00:17:59.718 --> 00:18:02.278
What's wrong with you?!
Why won't you answer me?!

00:18:15.834 --> 00:18:22.763
PACO-PACO!!!

00:18:37.856 --> 00:18:38.914
Captain!

00:18:42.060 --> 00:18:42.685
Highness!

00:18:43.528 --> 00:18:44.324
Captain!

00:18:44.696 --> 00:18:46.891
He's a goner!
He isn't moving at all!

00:18:50.135 --> 00:18:50.863
Don't shoot!

00:18:57.509 --> 00:19:00.444
What's happening?
Why won't they shoot?

00:19:04.716 --> 00:19:08.812
Paco-Paco...
Paco-Paco saved my life...

00:19:09.754 --> 00:19:10.914
Tylor did?!

00:19:14.893 --> 00:19:16.690
Dom, tell the others.

00:19:16.895 --> 00:19:20.626
I'm going with Paco-Paco
to the enemy ship.

00:19:21.166 --> 00:19:22.030
You're what?!

00:19:22.467 --> 00:19:24.492
We can't save him on the Melva!

00:19:24.569 --> 00:19:26.036
But, this is!

00:19:26.237 --> 00:19:27.568
That's an order!

00:19:40.585 --> 00:19:43.053
I still have
something to tell him.

00:19:44.923 --> 00:19:46.891
Once I have, I swear...

00:19:48.593 --> 00:19:49.491
I swear...

00:19:50.595 --> 00:19:51.687
...I'll come back.

00:19:53.264 --> 00:19:54.424
Highness...

00:20:00.205 --> 00:20:04.574
I am Goza the 16th, Empress
of the Holy Raalgon Empire!

00:20:05.610 --> 00:20:08.010
You will conduct
me to your vessel!

00:20:08.213 --> 00:20:10.044
The... The EMPRESS?!

00:20:10.582 --> 00:20:12.174
No wonder
they weren't shooting.

00:20:35.640 --> 00:20:39.906
How could this have happened?!
It's that blasted Tylor's fault!

00:20:41.246 --> 00:20:46.115
Tylor, you must live!
Live, and in my place...

00:20:53.324 --> 00:20:55.224
Protect the empress!

00:21:04.836 --> 00:21:07.999
Let's get this
